abstract: >-
  bdd2pw is an open-source Node.js package that automates the transformation
  of Behavior-Driven Development (BDD) specifications written in Gherkin
  .feature files into executable Playwright TypeScript test suites. It is the
  first npm package to integrate the Microsoft Playwright Model Context Protocol
  (MCP) server for live-DOM Page Object Model scaffolding. A governed
  large-language-model fallback (Anthropic Claude, OpenAI GPT, Google Gemini)
  handles ambiguous mappings.

